  "change_note": "Mac integration pairs fixed Core 81045511, combining accepted v16 source-support recall with completed preparation history and same-message memory replay fixes. Historical pre-revision-projection artifacts are readable only with complete early-epoch receipts and exact source bytes, and remain read-only without execution or edit authority. Duplicate identical memory writes within one trusted teacher message reuse the persisted receipt. Runtime schema/reasons, Bridge v1.1, occurrence v1.2 and Pi1.0.2 remain unchanged; complete dual component closures are enforced. No automatic real-root migration, external send, policy acceptance or public feed update is introduced."
